{{! /freestyle/records — per-trick consecutive records }}

<div class="hero hero-sm">
  <div>
    {{#if navigation.breadcrumbs}}
    <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      {{#each navigation.breadcrumbs}}
        {{#if href}}<a href="{{href}}">{{label}}</a> <span class="breadcrumb-sep">/</span> {{else}}<span>{{label}}</span>{{/if}}
      {{/each}}
    </nav>
    {{/if}}
    <h1>{{page.title}}</h1>
    {{#if page.intro}}<p class="hero-subtitle">{{page.intro}}</p>{{/if}}
  </div>
</div>

<div class="wrapper">

  <p>{{#each content.introSegments}}{{#if href}}<a href="{{href}}">{{text}}</a>{{else}}{{text}}{{/if}}{{/each}}</p>

  <p>
    A consecutive record is the most times a player has landed a single
    trick in a row without a miss. It is a test of focus and endurance as
    much as skill. The records below are the documented bests, grouped by
    type.
  </p>
  {{#if content.leaderSegments.length}}
  <p>{{#each content.leaderSegments}}{{#if href}}<a href="{{href}}">{{text}}</a>{{else}}{{text}}{{/if}}{{/each}}</p>
  {{/if}}

  {{#if content.curatorReviewCount}}
  <p class="fs-sm">
    Records marked <span class="record-review-flag">Needs curator review</span>
    are valid historical records whose name does not yet map to a settled trick
    in the dictionary. They are kept exactly as recorded and are not linked to a
    dictionary trick until the trick is confirmed.
  </p>
  {{/if}}

  {{#if content.groups}}
    {{#each content.groups}}
    <section class="records-group">
      <h2 class="section-heading">{{label}}</h2>

      {{> freestyle-record-table records=records label=label showTrick=true showHolder=true showAdds=true}}

    </section>
    {{/each}}
  {{else}}
  <div class="empty-state">No records found.</div>
  {{/if}}

  {{#if content.fearlessProgression.length}}
  <section class="records-group">
    <h2 class="section-heading">Unique Fearless Over the Years</h2>
    <p>
      The record for the most distinct tricks of 5 ADD or higher landed in one run
      has climbed for nearly two decades. The two earliest marks are provisional:
      they are recorded but not yet confirmed.
    </p>
    <ul>
      {{#each content.fearlessProgression}}
      <li>{{value}} · {{#if holderHref}}<a href="{{holderHref}}">{{holderName}}</a>{{else}}{{holderName}}{{/if}}{{#if year}} · {{year}}{{/if}}{{#if statusLabel}} ({{statusLabel}}){{/if}}</li>
      {{/each}}
    </ul>
  </section>
  {{/if}}

  <p class="source-note">
    These records are drawn from documented freestyle video archives and
    community tracking; historical coverage is incomplete and keeps growing.
    A date shown as a month or a year is known only that precisely.
    The records are well documented from video evidence, but most have not
    been independently verified.
  </p>

  {{> back-link}}
</div>
